goals.text:
{{W|What's Eating the Watervine?}}

{{white|&Gû&y &YTravel to Red Rock}}

{{white|&Yù Find the Vermin}}
   {{y|Find the creatures that are eating Joppa's watervine.}}

{{white|&Yù Get a Corpse}}
   {{y|Collect a corpse from one of the creatures.}}

{{white|&Yù Return with the Corpse}}
   {{y|Return to Joppa with the corpse of the watervine vermin.}}

Mehmet / Joppa

mutations.level_text:
Claw penetration vs. walls: {{rules|+3}}
Claws destroy walls after 4 penetrating hits.
Claws are also a short-blade class natural weapon that deal {{rules|1d2}} base damage to non-walls.

You produce ambient light within a radius of {{rules|4}}.
You may focus the light into a laser beam, temporarily reducing the radius of your ambient light by 1.
Laser damage increment: {{rules|1d3}}
Laser penetration: {{rules|8}}
Ambient light recharges at a rate of 1 unit every 15 rounds until it reaches its maximum value.
{{rules|13%}} chance to reflect light-based damage

item_details.description:
A length of brinestalk is wrapped in oil-sodden cloth.

{{rules|Offhand Attack Chance: 15%}}

{{K|Weight: 1 lbs.}}

Damp leather wraps the wood haft up to a sharpened bit of bell bronze.

{{rules|Strength Bonus Cap: 1
Weapon Class: Axe (cleaves armor on critical hit)}}

{{K|Weight: 5 lbs.}}

Bear flesh was cut into neat strips, salted, and smoked.

{{rules|Adds HP-based effects to cooked meals.}}

{{K|Weight: 0 lbs.}}

Lichen sticks in the winding grooves of woodshed, shimmering and smelling of spice.

{{rules|Heals and confuses when eaten.}}

{{K|Weight: 4 lbs.}}

